  {
   "id": "angels-with-scaly-wings-27068@1.07",
   "gameId": "angels-with-scaly-wings-27068",
   "displayName": "Update 1.07",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2018-04-02T16:16:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It's been quite a while since our last update. After a lot of work, this is one of our most significant updates since release and provides a number of additions besides the usual fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What has changed?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Courtesy of some fan developers who have previously created modding tools for AwSW, we have now also added full Steam Workshop integration for Windows, which means Steam users can now easily download and add mods to the game from the Steam Workshop (and even from inside the game itself)!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "For details about mods (and how to create one yourself), just head over to the Steam Workshop.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have a prior version of the mod tools installed, you may encounter an error on launching the game. To prevent and/or fix this, please check out this topic: http://steamcommunity.com/workshop/discussions/18446744073709551615/1696043263505274976/?appid=571880",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Next, for people who own the Digital Deluxe Edition, we have cleaned up the tags for the soundtrack, which should fix any strange behaviors people experienced when using the soundtrack with various other pieces of software.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additionally, we have also added a higher quality version of the soundtrack in a separate folder.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Of course, we also made some changes to the game itself",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "An error with the task bar icon not showing up correctly on certain devices has been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A certain function during a certain scene that was notorious for crashing and severe lag has been changed to be more stable and responsive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "An instance of the wrong character receiving abandoned status after certain decisions has been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A big number of text errors have been fixed.: To celebrate, we've also put the game on its biggest sale yet at 40% off during this week! With the added mod support, newcomers will have more to discover than ever before.: For us, this update is our way of thanking you, the fans, for your continued support. We hope you enjoy it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
