    {
     "title": "Here's what we did",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Various small fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a song to the soundtrack.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Steam achievements support.: People who have had prior issues with Steam achievements syncing should get missing Steam achievements upon starting the game and/or starting a new playthrough (with the START button in the main menu).: Should this not work for whatever reason, we have found installing Steam and the game on a different computer should solve the issue of the syncing not working properly.",
